[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500500_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500500_04_0010","text":"“因恶劣天气，前方5公里拥堵”吗\n看来要堵很久了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500500_04_0020","text":"甜花，你可以先睡一会儿\n到了我叫你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500500_04_0030","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500500_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500500_04_0040","text":"啊呜……\n甜花，昨天是休息日……所以"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500500_04_0050","text":"睡了好多……\n现在……可能睡不着了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500500_04_0060","text":"这样啊……那也没办法\n那要不要玩个词语接龙？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500500_04_0070","text":"嗯……\n反正也无聊……玩吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500500_04_0080","text":"好，我可不会输的……！\n那就从甜花开始吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500500_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500500_04_0090","text":"嗯……\n嗯……橘子……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500500_04_0100","text":"嗯——……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500500_04_0101","text":"Motion"}]
